OL,3,GNEWSAFirst flu jab event held for
OL,4,Ahomeless people
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first pop-up clinic in Bournemouth
OL,7,Fto offer winter flu jabs to homeless
OL,8,Fpeople has been held as part of a
OL,9,Fnational vaccination campaign.
OL,11,FThe NHS is offering people with
OL,12,Fincreased health risks due to sleeping
OL,13,Frough or living without fixed
OL,14,Faccommodation a free flu jab for the
OL,15,Ffirst time this winter.
OL,17,FMore than 40 people were vaccinated and
OL,18,Freceived health checks at the Winter
OL,19,FWellness session at St Swithun's Church
OL,20,Fin Bournemouth
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
